  Description: "COMPANION / PRISMATIC / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nWave income +15 per talent.
    During combat, the hero spends 0.5 HP every 5s while at least one Philip talent
    is present; this health cost does not stack by copies and bypasses armor/dodge.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Healing per second: +0.04\nChampion / Movement speed:
    -0.3%\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies
    and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level
    unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource:
    dream shop or special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds:
    frost, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
